@startuml
title Concept B: Desk Buddy Speech Therapy

[*] --> Init
state Init : power on device

Init --> Running : ready

state Running {
  state Sampling : read microphone
  state Processing : compute loudness (dB)
  state Feedback : send visual/audio feedback to user
  Sampling --> Processing
  Processing --> Sampling
  Processing --> Feedback
  state Bluetooth : transfer data to smartphone/laptop
  Processing --> Bluetooth : send data

}



state Error : sensor or Bluetooth failure
Running --> Error : failure
Error --> Init : retry
Running --> [*] : power off

@enduml